<!doctype html>
<html lang="pt-BR">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
  <title><%= pageTitle %> · RouteX</title>
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/style.css">
</head>
<body class="auth-page">
  <main class="auth-shell">
    <section class="auth-panel auth-intro">
      <div class="brand brand-large"><span class="brand-mark">RX</span><span>Route<strong>X</strong></span></div>
      <h1>Planejamento operacional de rotas</h1>
      <p>Rotas, histórico operacional e agenda compartilhada do veículo em uma única central logística.</p>
      <div class="auth-feature-grid">
        <span>Otimização de rotas</span><span>Histórico por usuário</span><span>Agenda compartilhada</span><span>Google Maps + XLSX</span>
      </div>
    </section>
    <section class="auth-panel auth-form-panel">
      <div class="auth-form-wrap">
        <span class="eyebrow">Acesso ao sistema</span>
        <h2>Entrar</h2>
        <p class="muted">Use sua conta já cadastrada ou crie uma nova.</p>
        <%- include('partials/messages') %>
        <form method="post" action="/auth/login" class="stack-form">
          <label>E-mail<input type="email" name="email" required autocomplete="email" autofocus></label>
          <label>Senha<input type="password" name="password" required autocomplete="current-password"></label>
          <button class="button button-primary button-block" type="submit">Entrar no RouteX</button>
        </form>
        <p class="auth-link">Primeiro acesso? <a href="/auth/register">Criar conta</a></p>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
</body>
</html>
